data: {"id": "1ec3cea6b2104579-thinking-parallel_evidence-1210", "run_id": "1ec3cea6b2104579", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n**实体身份**\n- Pod: `aiops-case-v07/workload`, UID: `eba255e0-be57-450d-b073-b2c0a356f22e`, 调度到 `node2`, IP: `172.16.104.37`, 容器 `app`.\n\n**已确认的事实（支持 ImagePullBackOff）**\n1. **Kubernetes 事件**（决定性证据）：kubelet 返回 `Failed to pull image \"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908\"`，错误原文为 `rpc error: code = NotFound desc = ... failed to resolve reference ... : not found`。这明确表明 **镜像或 tag 不存在于仓库中**。\n2. **Pod YAML**：`imagePullSecrets` 为空（`<absent>`），未配", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789443761821, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

